<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for April 7-13 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		    Apr 7-13   April 8-14	TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		    1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    347.865.8   377,505.1</p>
<p> Production		 0	     0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	  17,476.7    15,875.3     915,672.4    750,809.1</p>
<p> Home Market	  395.5	 388.3	13,461.2     15,306.4</p>
<p> Stocks/close   329,993.6   361,241.5</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
